     LL and WW become ss segments, a BB box its four, a PP polyline
     its n-1, CC a circle, AA an arc angles and all, and a TT whose
     text is ONE CHARACTER a tt glyph.  Everything else - shapes,
     connectors, dimensions, nested symbols and multi-character
